  "details": "The \"Order In Layer\" option on Sprite Rendeder components always resets to 0 no matter what value you put before uploading/testing. I am able to change the order layer at runtime (see video), but they will always start at 0. \n[VIDEO]\nhttps://streamable.com/63hcy9\nIn the video, I have a script (picture) that On Update it displays the current Order Layer of the sprite renderer into a text. The first part is on Unity Play mode. I set the order to 10, press PLAY, it displays 10. \nI then leave it at 10 and press \"build and test.\" The layer shown in game reads it as being 0, even though I uploaded it with a layer order of 10.\nI have 3 buttons that change the sprite order layer at runtime, and it works as intendent.  \nThis problem only happens on the Beta client.",
